        <mxCell id="z21" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints &amp;amp; indexes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• users.role: CHECK (role IN (&amp;#39;user&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;admin&amp;#39;))&lt;br&gt;• users.email UNIQUE; social_accounts UNIQUE (provider, provider_id)&lt;br&gt;• users.password is NULL for accounts created through social login&lt;br&gt;• Blocking an account sets is_blocked and publishes user.blocked; unblocking publishes user.unblocked"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1320" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
